{"ticker":{"symbol":"061970.KQ","name":"LB세미콘","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2830.0,"change_pct":-0.01565217391304352,"market_cap":179281772544.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":2350.0,"week52_high":7120.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"South Korea","city":"Pyeongtaek-Si","employees":1498,"website":"https://www.lbsemicon.com","business_summary":"LB Semicon Inc. provides flip-chip wafer bumping technology solutions in South Korea. It offers wafer-level packaging technology for packaging and testing integrated circuits; gold bumped wafers, which are applied on various packages, such as chip on glass, chip on film, and chip on plastic; solder bumps for various flip chip packages; Cu pillar bumps; Au RDL, which is used to reposition the layout of the I/O pad; and thick Cu products. The company also provides chip probe test; and back-end services, such as laminating, back grinding, laser marking and grooving, SAW, plasma, post AVI, UV irradiation, pick and place, AVI, visual inspection and packing services, as well as back side coating, foil mount, and tape and reel. LB Semicon Inc. was founded in 2000 and is based in Pyeongtaek-Si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"LB Semicon Inc.는 한국에서 플립칩 웨이퍼 범핑 기술 솔루션을 제공합니다. 집적 회로 패키징 및 테스트를 위한 웨이퍼 수준 패키징 기술을 제공합니다. Chip on Glass, Chip on Film, Chip on Plastic 등 다양한 패키지에 적용되는 Gold Bumped Wafer; 다양한 플립 칩 패키지용 솔더 범프; Cu 기둥 범프; I/O 패드의 레이아웃을 재배치하는 데 사용되는 Au RDL 두꺼운 Cu 제품. 이 회사는 또한 칩 프로브 테스트도 제공합니다. 라미네이팅, 백 그라인딩, 레이저 마킹 및 홈 가공, SAW, 플라즈마, 포스트 AVI, UV 조사, 픽 앤 플레이스, AVI, 육안 검사 및 포장 서비스는 물론 후면 코팅, 호일 마운트, 테이프 및 릴과 같은 백엔드 서비스도 포함됩니다. LB Semicon Inc.는 2000년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 평택시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"반도체","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":524605333970.0,"operating_incom